msgid "处理Ascend NPU特有的编译提示指令 (`extension.compile_hint`)，将其转换为后端的Annotation方言，用于指导后续的硬件特定优化或资源配置。"
msgstr "This step processes the Ascend NPU-specific compilation hint instruction (`extension.compile_hint`), converting it into the backend Annotation dialect to guide subsequent hardware-specific optimizations or resource configurations."

msgid "TritonAnnotationConversion"
msgstr "TritonAnnotationConversion"

