msgid "triton-to-hfusion"
msgstr "triton-to-hfusion"

msgid "将Triton中的`TTIR`转换为Ascend NPU硬件加速器`HFusion`方言中的对应操作。"
msgstr "Converts `TTIR` in Triton to the corresponding operations in the `HFusion` dialect of the Ascend NPU hardware accelerator."

msgid "TritonHistogramToHFusionConversion"
msgstr "TritonHistogramToHFusionConversion"

msgid "将 `triton::HistogramOp` 转换为 `hfusion::HistogramOp`，使其能在NPU的专用硬件上高效执行。"
msgstr "Convert `triton::HistogramOp` to `hfusion::HistogramOp` so that it can execute efficiently on the dedicated NPU hardware."

msgid "triton-to-hivm"
msgstr "triton-to-hivm"

msgid "处理Triton的块同步操作 (`extension.sync_block_all`, `extension.sync_block_set`, `extension.sync_block_wait`)，将其转换为Ascend NPU的`HIVM`方言中的跨核心同步指令。这些指令用于管理多核流水线中的同步与数据依赖，是流水优化的关键。"
msgstr "Process Triton block synchronization operations (`extension.sync_block_all`, `extension.sync_block_set`, `extension.sync_block_wait`) and convert them into cross-core synchronization instructions in the Ascend NPU `HIVM` dialect. These instructions manage synchronization and data dependencies in multi-core pipelines, and are key to pipeline optimization."

msgid "TritonCustomOpToHIVMSyncOpConversion"
msgstr "TritonCustomOpToHIVMSyncOpConversion"

msgid "实现Triton同步指令到HIVM同步指令的转换：`sync_block_all`（全局块同步）；`sync_block_set`（设置同步点）；`sync_block_wait`（等待同步点）"
msgstr "Implement the conversion of Triton synchronization instructions to HIVM synchronization instructions: `sync_block_all` (global block synchronization); `sync_block_set` (set synchronization point); `sync_block_wait` (wait for synchronization point)"

msgid "triton-to-llvm"
msgstr "triton-to-llvm"

