msgstr "The compiler converts the inline assembly operation in Triton (`extension.inline_assembly`) to the inline assembly of the LLVM dialect, and finally maps it to the CCE hardware intrinsics of the Ascend NPU."

msgid "ElementwiseInlineAsmOpConversion"
msgstr "ElementwiseInlineAsmOpConversion"

