msgstr "Convert `triton::ElementwiseInlineAsmOp` to `LLVM::InlineAsmOp`."

msgid "<a id=\"dynamic-cv-pipeline\"></a>"
msgstr "<a id=\"dynamic-cv-pipeline\"></a>"

msgid "<a id=\"dynamic-cv-pipeline\">"
msgstr "<a id=\"dynamic-cv-pipeline\">"

msgid "</a>"
msgstr "</a>"

msgid "3.2.2.5 DynamicCV 流水优化（Ascend 950）"
msgstr "3.2.2.5 DynamicCV Pipeline Optimization (Ascend 950)"

msgid "DynamicCV 用于优化同时包含 Cube 矩阵计算和 Vector 计算的 kernel。编译器分析数据依赖、划分计算块，并插入多缓冲和核间同步，使可并行的计算与数据搬运交错执行，减少相互等待。"
msgstr "DynamicCV optimizes kernels that contain both Cube matrix calculations and Vector calculations. The compiler analyzes data dependencies, divides computation blocks, and inserts multi-buffering and cross-core synchronization. This interleaves parallelizable computations and data movements, reducing mutual waiting."

msgid "设置 `enable_dynamic_cv_pipeline=True` 后，编译器会尝试应用这项优化。若 kernel 不满足优化条件（例如不包含矩阵乘法），或优化无法完成，编译器会将 IR **回退**到本次优化前的状态，将 `enable_dynamic_cv_pipeline` 置为 `False`，并恢复由该优化调整的编译选项，随后继续编译。开关的默认值、关联选项和缓冲槽配置见[编译选项参考表](./environment_variable_and_compiler_options_reference.md#compiler-options-reference)。"
msgstr "After you set `enable_dynamic_cv_pipeline=True`, the compiler attempts to apply this optimization. If the kernel does not meet the optimization conditions (for example, it does not contain matrix multiplication) or the optimization cannot be completed, the compiler **rolls back** the IR to the state before this optimization. The compiler sets `enable_dynamic_cv_pipeline` to `False`, restores the compilation options adjusted by this optimization, and then continues compiling. For the default value of this option, related options, and buffer slot configuration, refer to the [compiler options reference table](./environment_variable_and_compiler_options_reference.md#compiler-options-reference)."

msgid "3.2.3 SIMT 编译器（Ascend 950PR&950DT系列产品）"
msgstr "3.2.3 SIMT Compiler (Ascend 950PR&950DT products)"

msgid "Ascend 950PR&950DT系列产品 在 SIMD 路径之外增加 SIMT 能力，用于加速**非结构化 / 离散**访存（如间接索引的 load/store）。 开发者通过 `compile_mode` 选择编译路径。"
msgstr "The Ascend 950PR&950DT products add SIMT capability in addition to the SIMD path to accelerate **unstructured / discrete** memory access (such as indirect-indexed load/store). Developers select the compilation path through `compile_mode`."

msgid "3.2.3.1 `compile_mode` 说明"
msgstr "3.2.3.1 `compile_mode` Description"

msgid "`compile_mode`"
msgstr "`compile_mode`"

msgid "含义"
msgstr "Description"

msgid "编译路径"
msgstr "Compilation path"

msgid "`\"simd\"`"
msgstr "`\"simd\"`"

msgid "纯 SIMD：结构化访存走 DMA；非结构化走标量循环"
msgstr "Pure SIMD: Structured memory access uses DMA; unstructured memory access uses scalar loops."

msgid "`Triton IR → Linalg IR → AscendNPU IR`"
msgstr "`Triton IR → Linalg IR → AscendNPU IR`"

msgid "`\"simd_simt_template\"`（**默认**）"
msgstr "`\"simd_simt_template\"` (**Default**)"

msgid "混合：结构化仍走 SIMD；离散访存尽量走 SIMT 模板"
msgstr "Hybrid: structured memory access still uses SIMD; irregular memory access uses SIMT templates wherever possible"

msgid "`\"simt_only\"`"
msgstr "`\"simt_only\"`"

msgid "纯 SIMT：直接下发 Triton IR 给NPU IR处理"
msgstr "Pure SIMT: directly dispatch Triton IR to NPU IR for processing"

msgid "`Triton IR → AscendNPU IR`"
msgstr "`Triton IR → AscendNPU IR`"

