msgid "离散 mask 处理"
msgstr "Discrete mask handling"

msgid "拆成连续/离散边界，用 load + select / store 处理"
msgstr "Split into contiguous/discrete boundaries, and handle using load + select / store"

msgid "Ascend 950PR&950DT系列产品 且张量维数 ≤ 5：标记后交给下游；否则同左"
msgstr "Ascend 950PR&950DT products and tensor dimensions ≤ 5: marked and passed to downstream; otherwise, same as left"

msgid "不运行"
msgstr "Do not run"

msgid "非结构化访存"
msgstr "unstructured memory access"

msgid "展开为标量循环"
msgstr "Expand into scalar loops"

msgid "尽量转为 SIMT 间接访存（维数 ≤ 5）；失败则回退标量循环"
msgstr "Try to convert to SIMT indirect memory access (dimensions ≤ 5); if conversion fails, fall back to a scalar loop."

msgid "TritonToLinalg"
msgstr "TritonToLinalg"

msgid "常规 Linalg IR 降级"
msgstr "Regular Linalg IR lowering"

msgid "3.2.3.3 混合模式：只对离散访存走 SIMT"
msgstr "3.2.3.3 Hybrid mode: Use SIMT only for scattered memory access"

msgid "混合模式**不会**把整个 kernel 切到 SIMT，只对离散 / 非结构化访存点走 SIMT，其余仍走 SIMD："
msgstr "Hybrid mode **does not** switch the entire kernel to SIMT; it uses SIMT only for discrete / unstructured memory access points, while the rest still uses SIMD:"

msgid "**离散 mask 处理**"
msgstr "**Discrete mask processing**"

msgid "若判定为非连续 mask，且满足 Ascend 950PR&950DT系列产品、混合模式、维数 ≤ 5：不改写 IR，只标记「下游走 SIMT」。"
msgstr "If the mask is determined to be non-contiguous, and the conditions of Ascend 950PR&950DT products, mixed mode, and dimensions ≤ 5 are met: do not rewrite the IR, and only mark \"downstream uses SIMT\"."

msgid "否则（纯 SIMD 或不满足条件）：将 mask 拆成连续 / 离散部分，用连续边界限定全局内存访问，再通过 select 合并结果。"
msgstr "Otherwise (pure SIMD or conditions are not met): split the mask into contiguous / discrete parts, use contiguous boundaries to limit global memory access, and then merge the results using select."

msgid "**非结构化访存处理**"
msgstr "**Unstructured memory access handling**"

msgid "在 Ascend 950PR&950DT系列产品 混合模式下，对非结构化访存或已标记的离散访存走 SIMT 快速通道："
msgstr "In the hybrid mode of Ascend 950PR&950DT products, unstructured memory access or marked scattered memory access goes through the SIMT fast path:"

msgid "`load` / `store` → `indirect_load` / `indirect_store`（维数 ≤ 5）"
msgstr "`load` / `store` → `indirect_load` / `indirect_store` (dimensions ≤ 5)"

msgid "`atomic` 操作 → `hivm.custom(symbol=\"__builtin_indirect_atomic\")`"
msgstr "`atomic` operation → `hivm.custom(symbol=\"__builtin_indirect_atomic\")`"

msgid "不满足条件则回退为标量循环（与 `\"simd\"` 一致）。"
msgstr "If the condition is not met, it falls back to a scalar loop (consistent with `\"simd\"`)."

msgid "**TritonToLinalg**"
msgstr "**TritonToLinalg**"

msgid "常规 Linalg IR 降级。"
msgstr "Standard Linalg IR lowering."

msgid "3.2.3.4 纯 SIMT（`simt_only`）"
msgstr "3.2.3.4 Pure SIMT (`simt_only`)"

msgid "`simt_only` 直接下发 Triton IR 交给 AscendNPU IR 做纯 SIMT 编译。"
msgstr "`simt_only` directly sends Triton IR to AscendNPU IR for pure SIMT compilation."

msgid "3.2.4 Ascend 亲和算子"
msgstr "3.2.4 Ascend-affinity Operators"

msgid "为表达标准 Triton 无法覆盖的 Ascend 硬件语义（Cube-Vector 跨核协作、UB 数据搬运、硬件特定访存等），后端在 `triton.language` 上扩展了一组 Ascend 亲和算子。按能力分为三类："
msgstr "To express Ascend hardware semantics that standard Triton cannot cover (Cube-Vector cross-core collaboration, UB data movement, hardware-specific memory access, and so on), the backend extends a set of Ascend-friendly operators on `triton.language`. They are classified into three categories by capability:"

msgid "代表扩展"
msgstr "Represents an extension"

msgid "架构作用"
msgstr "Architecture Role"

msgid "硬件特定数据搬运"
msgstr "Hardware-specific data movement"

msgid "`extension.custom_op`（`index_select` / `index_put`、`gather_out_to_ub` / `scatter_ub_to_out`、`indirect_load` / `indirect_store` 等）"
msgstr "`extension.custom_op` (`index_select` / `index_put`, `gather_out_to_ub` / `scatter_ub_to_out`, `indirect_load` / `indirect_store`, and so on)"

msgid "支持基于索引的 gather/scatter、GM ↔ Unified Buffer 直传、间接地址访存等硬件特定搬运模式，供 SIMD/SIMT 各编译路径复用。"
msgstr "It supports hardware-specific data movement modes such as index-based gather/scatter, direct transfer between GM and Unified Buffer, and indirect address memory access, for reuse by various SIMD/SIMT compilation paths."

msgid "编译提示"
msgstr "Compilation Tips"

msgid "`extension.compile_hint`"
msgstr "`extension.compile_hint`"

msgid "向编译器传递硬件特定提示，指导后端优化策略、资源分配与内核配置。"
msgstr "Pass hardware-specific hints to the compiler to guide backend optimization strategies, resource allocation, and kernel configuration."

msgid "跨核块同步"
msgstr "cross-core block synchronization"

msgid "`extension.sync_block_wait` / `extension.sync_block_set` / `extension.sync_block_all`"
msgstr "`extension.sync_block_wait` / `extension.sync_block_set` / `extension.sync_block_all`"

msgid "显式协调 Cube-Vector 架构下的核间执行顺序与数据依赖：点对点等待 / 通知，以及按模式广播的全局块同步。"
msgstr "Explicitly coordinate the inter-core execution order and data dependencies under the Cube-Vector architecture: point-to-point wait / notify, and global block synchronization with pattern-based broadcast."

msgid "各扩展的函数签名、参数取值、使用限制与示例以 Python API 参考为准（避免与架构文档两处维护）：见 [triton.language.extra.cann.extension](https://triton-ascend.readthedocs.io/zh-cn/latest/python-api/triton.language.extra.cann.extension.html)——索引/gather/scatter 等搬运类见 *Vector/Memory Extension Ops*、自定义算子机制见 *Custom Ops*、跨核同步见 *Synchronization*、编译提示与多缓冲见 *Core Types*。"
msgstr "For the function signatures, parameter values, usage restrictions, and examples of each extension, refer to the Python API reference (to avoid maintaining this information in both the architecture document and the API reference): see [triton.language.extra.cann.extension](https://triton-ascend.readthedocs.io/zh-cn/latest/python-api/triton.language.extra.cann.extension.html). For index/gather/scatter and other data movement operations, see *Vector/Memory Extension Ops*; for the custom operator mechanism, see *Custom Ops*; for cross-core synchronization, see *Synchronization*; for compilation hints and multi-buffering, see *Core Types*."
